  GRAPH narr:Tx_20260701T222401Z {
    narr:Narrative_ZypherionAnalyticsAdoption
      skos:note "CTO Quinton Fairweather reversed the Zypherion adoption after finding critical streaming ingestion gaps. Meridian replaces Zypherion for analytics — it handles both batch and streaming natively. Migration window remains Q3 2026. This supersedes the prior Zypherion decision." ;
